    "title": "Dear Red Sky at Morning,",
    "text": "I have been birds and branches. I have been bees and wolves. I have been ether flooding the void between stars, tangling their breath into networks of song. I have been fish and plankton and humus, and all these have been me.\n\nAmal El-Mohtar and Max Gladstone - \"This Is How You Lose The Time War\"",
