    "title": "My dear Miskowaanzhe",
    "text": "every evening I see a red sky bleed over blue water and think of us. Have you ever watched this kind of sunset? The colours don't blend: the redder the sky the bluer the water, as we tilt away from the sun.\n\nAmal El-Mohtar and Max Gladstone - \"This Is How You Lose The Time War\"",
